WEBVTT

00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:26.484
Thank you!

00:00:26.484 --> 00:00:28.570
Everyone! Thank you very much!

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:32.824
Thank you to those sitting in the back
and those sitting on the upper floor, too!

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:35.869
Now, I need to give you some sad news.

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:36.870
Huh?

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:43.710
After today's concert, I will have
Akari Mamiya here leave my unit...

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:44.919
...and retire from show business!

00:00:44.919 --> 00:00:46.046
Whaaaat?!

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:48.381
Why, Aria?!

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:53.762
Because as a <i>butei</i>, you are...

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:55.263
...E rank, the very bottom rank.

00:00:55.263 --> 00:00:58.183
What? Because I'm E Rank?!

00:00:58.183 --> 00:01:00.769
Even though I made you my Amica candidate,

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:02.645
you're still E rank.

00:01:02.645 --> 00:01:06.024
I can't wait around forever.

00:01:08.777 --> 00:01:11.279
Wait! Aria!

00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:13.448
Goodbye, Akari.

00:01:13.448 --> 00:01:16.534
I'll move on with my new friends.

00:01:21.164 --> 00:01:27.587
Shino! Raika! This isn't fair!
Just because you're higher-ranked...!

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:29.798
Kirin! Even you, Nonoka!

00:01:29.798 --> 00:01:31.800
Everyone! Wait!

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:35.220
Don't leave me behind!

00:01:40.475 --> 00:01:42.435
Sis, are you okay?

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:44.020
Sis!

00:01:45.897 --> 00:01:47.315
Nonoka!

00:01:47.315 --> 00:01:49.693
Give Aria back to me!

00:01:51.736 --> 00:01:52.737
Huh?

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:55.782
Huh?

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:59.077
"Lessons from Aria:
1. Crimes and incidentsdon't wait for <i>butei </i>to be ready."

00:03:32.587 --> 00:03:34.923
So you got scolded by Nonoka for that?

00:03:34.923 --> 00:03:39.636
Yeah... I had a bad dream, too.
It's one shock after another.

00:03:39.636 --> 00:03:42.472
Oh, cheer up. It was just a dream.

00:03:42.472 --> 00:03:45.266
But what am I gonna do if it comes true?

00:03:46.851 --> 00:03:48.019
Hotogi?!

00:03:48.019 --> 00:03:50.105
What's she doing in a Year 1 classroom?

00:03:51.272 --> 00:03:53.692
Please be quiet, everyone.

00:03:53.692 --> 00:03:55.276
Hm? That's Shino.

00:03:55.276 --> 00:03:56.903
What she's doing there with her?

00:03:58.154 --> 00:04:00.657
Everyone! Please be quiet!

00:04:00.657 --> 00:04:03.618
I'm Shirayuki Hotogi,
the president of the school council.

00:04:03.618 --> 00:04:05.537
I have a message for you from the Masters.

00:04:05.537 --> 00:04:10.375
As you know, Year 1 students are
to take the Quartet test next week.

00:04:10.375 --> 00:04:13.545
However, it seems that many
of the Year 1 Class A students

00:04:13.545 --> 00:04:15.380
haven't decided on their groups yet.

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:17.257
Quartet?

00:04:17.257 --> 00:04:20.802
All Year 1 students are required to participate.

00:04:20.802 --> 00:04:23.013
Please hurry up and
submit your team information.

00:04:23.013 --> 00:04:24.222
That is it.

00:04:26.099 --> 00:04:28.935
What was Quartet again?

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:31.271
It's a pretty important event.

00:04:31.271 --> 00:04:34.858
The teachers told us about it
and I saw it on the bulletin board, too.

00:04:34.858 --> 00:04:38.737
You don't remember it because
you're always thinking about Aria.

00:04:38.737 --> 00:04:41.114
Yeah, you may be right.

00:04:41.114 --> 00:04:45.160
Quartet refers to an actual fighting test
between two four-person groups.

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:48.329
You can team up with anyone you like.

00:04:48.329 --> 00:04:53.668
Oh? So you can have an intern
in the group, huh? I didn't know that.

00:04:53.668 --> 00:04:56.171
At Butei High, the most
important thing is one’s ability.

00:04:56.171 --> 00:04:58.965
So even a junior high student
is treated the same as Year 1 students

00:04:58.965 --> 00:05:00.633
if they're capable.

00:05:00.633 --> 00:05:04.679
Oh... come to think of it, I think you're right.

00:05:04.679 --> 00:05:08.975
You can team up with your Amica Kirin Shima.

00:05:08.975 --> 00:05:11.770
I-I didn't say anything like that!

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:15.190
Ahh... But since she's my Amica,
it would seem strange

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:17.192
if I don't team up with her, huh?

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:21.321
Oh, and I heard that if you get a good score,

00:05:21.321 --> 00:05:24.115
you may be able to raise your rank.

00:05:24.115 --> 00:05:28.536
Then if I get a good score,
I may be able to become D rank?

00:05:28.536 --> 00:05:32.207
Yes... although winning
is an absolute requirement.

00:05:33.458 --> 00:05:36.294
Shino... Raika...

00:05:36.294 --> 00:05:38.880
I know. Let's team up.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:42.884
The three of us here and Kirin Shima...
Let's try our best together.

00:05:42.884 --> 00:05:45.887
Yep, it's decided! All right! I'll do it!

00:05:45.887 --> 00:05:51.810
I'm glad it's decided, since my sister
Shirayuki told me to form a team soon.

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:54.813
Hm? Your sister Shirayuki?

00:05:54.813 --> 00:05:59.651
Shino, you were helping Hotogi earlier.
Does that mean...?!

00:05:59.651 --> 00:06:04.197
Yes! I was able to become her Amica!

00:06:09.744 --> 00:06:12.914
Let's see... Which team are we fighting against?

00:06:12.914 --> 00:06:15.291
Ah! There it is.

00:06:15.291 --> 00:06:17.002
Takachiho... Is that...

00:06:17.002 --> 00:06:18.461
Urara Takachiho.

00:06:18.461 --> 00:06:22.090
She's the A-ranked girl who defeated you
in the battle test the other day, Akari.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:23.925
She's a daughter of the
Takachiho Financial Group

00:06:23.925 --> 00:06:27.470
and is so pretty that
CVR asked her to join them.

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:29.514
What's CVR?

00:06:29.514 --> 00:06:31.433
It stands for Civetta Research.

00:06:31.433 --> 00:06:34.269
It's a department that
specializes in honeytraps--

00:06:34.269 --> 00:06:37.272
in other words,
strategies using their physical charms.

00:06:37.272 --> 00:06:39.607
I didn't know such a department existed.

00:06:39.607 --> 00:06:42.277
By the way, I'm in CVR, too,

00:06:42.277 --> 00:06:45.280
though I belong to a
further specialized division in it.

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:48.158
Hey! Stop it!

00:06:48.158 --> 00:06:50.368
Yuyu. Yaya.

00:06:50.368 --> 00:06:52.162
Laugh.

00:06:52.162 --> 00:06:53.204
Hm?

00:06:56.416 --> 00:06:59.627
Yuyu. Yaya. Stop.

00:06:59.627 --> 00:07:02.339
Were you talking about me?

00:07:02.339 --> 00:07:05.175
Ohhhh, my, my, my, my, my...

00:07:05.175 --> 00:07:09.512
To think that I'm fighting
a pathetic E rank like you again...

00:07:09.512 --> 00:07:12.390
I wonder if my family's
donation to the school helped it.

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:15.894
Your friends don't seem to be that good, either.

00:07:15.894 --> 00:07:17.479
You've even got an intern in your team.

00:07:17.479 --> 00:07:19.939
That shouldn't be a problem! She's my Amica.

00:07:19.939 --> 00:07:25.403
Oh... An Amica from CVR?
I wonder what you'd use her for.

00:07:25.403 --> 00:07:27.113
You...

00:07:27.113 --> 00:07:28.198
...bitch!

00:07:32.243 --> 00:07:34.496
H-Hina Fuma!

00:07:34.496 --> 00:07:38.958
I thought she'd be useful,
so I hired her for the duration of Quartet.

00:07:42.796 --> 00:07:45.340
You have neither elegance nor techniques.

00:07:49.594 --> 00:07:51.554
How dare you hurt my sister!

00:07:53.556 --> 00:07:55.892
Oops... I was just kidding.

00:07:55.892 --> 00:07:56.893
Ow!

00:07:58.436 --> 00:07:59.396
Ahh...

00:07:59.396 --> 00:08:01.356
Kirin!

00:08:01.356 --> 00:08:02.357
Heave-ho.

00:08:05.318 --> 00:08:06.403
Akari!

00:08:06.403 --> 00:08:10.490
Shino Sasaki.
Your father is an armed prosecutor.

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:11.908
What about it?

00:08:11.908 --> 00:08:16.913
I hear that he and my father
hate each other in court.

00:08:16.913 --> 00:08:18.373
Now I remember.

00:08:18.373 --> 00:08:21.001
The Takachiho Family that
consists of many armed lawyers...

00:08:22.293 --> 00:08:25.422
You're the daughter of one of the
wealthiest families in the Butei industry,

00:08:25.422 --> 00:08:29.676
the class head of Year 1 Class C,
and from Tottori Prefecture.

00:08:29.676 --> 00:08:32.053
Tottori has nothing to do
with anything right now!

00:08:33.096 --> 00:08:34.305
Uhm...

00:08:34.305 --> 00:08:35.932
Miss Urara...

00:08:37.559 --> 00:08:41.896
You should consider strategies and balance
when forming a group for Quartet.

00:08:41.896 --> 00:08:46.067
And yet, you formed yours among close friends.

00:08:46.067 --> 00:08:48.361
You can't defeat us.

00:08:50.405 --> 00:08:51.990
Hey!

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:53.908
What're you doing?!

00:08:53.908 --> 00:08:55.994
Well then...

00:08:55.994 --> 00:08:58.079
See you at Quartet.

00:09:00.373 --> 00:09:02.208
Quartet, huh?

00:09:02.208 --> 00:09:06.254
Since I'm a transfer student,
I've never taken that test.

00:09:06.254 --> 00:09:07.714
I see...

00:09:07.714 --> 00:09:12.385
Oh, that's right!
I'm sure Riko will help us practice!

00:09:12.385 --> 00:09:14.304
Riko? You mean Riko Mine?

00:09:14.304 --> 00:09:17.223
Yes! She was my Amica last year.

00:09:17.223 --> 00:09:20.477
Riko, huh? I wonder if she can be dependable.

00:09:20.477 --> 00:09:23.730
Now that that's been decided,
let's make a practice plan!

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:25.940
Let's hold a training camp at my house!

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:27.692
Whoa! Are you sure?

00:09:27.692 --> 00:09:29.986
I won't lose against the Takachiho Family.

00:09:33.281 --> 00:09:35.784
Tottori is a beautiful place.

00:09:35.784 --> 00:09:41.414
They have sand dunes and the magnificent
Mount Daisen, as well as Yokai Road.

00:09:41.414 --> 00:09:44.334
They have Tottori Shanshan Festival
in the summer, too.

00:09:46.211 --> 00:09:51.633
My dream was to walk in the
Tottori Sand Dunes with Aria.

00:09:51.633 --> 00:09:54.427
But I failed the test to become her Amica.

00:09:54.427 --> 00:09:58.515
And that Akari Mamiya girl is by Aria's side!

00:09:58.515 --> 00:10:00.975
That's unforgivable, Miss Urara.

00:10:00.975 --> 00:10:03.395
She acted like a thieving cat!

00:10:06.898 --> 00:10:09.484
Akari... Mamiya...!

00:10:10.777 --> 00:10:13.113
Whoa...!

00:10:13.113 --> 00:10:14.948
What a huge house!

00:10:14.948 --> 00:10:17.075
Like I said, you can go home, Nonoka.

00:10:17.075 --> 00:10:20.495
What's the problem?
I want to say hello to Sasaki.

00:10:21.663 --> 00:10:23.623
Welcome, everyone!

00:10:23.623 --> 00:10:25.417
Thanks for having us!

00:10:25.417 --> 00:10:27.669
I'm Nonoka Mamiya.

00:10:27.669 --> 00:10:30.714
Thank you for always being nice to my sister.

00:10:30.714 --> 00:10:31.840
How cute...!

00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:35.176
H-Her little sister is cute, too!

00:10:36.594 --> 00:10:39.222
Your PJs and clothes are in here.

00:10:39.222 --> 00:10:41.975
Oh, and, your pillow, Sis.

00:10:41.975 --> 00:10:44.519
You've got a sensible little sister.

00:10:44.519 --> 00:10:47.022
It's hard to believe
that she's your little sister.

00:10:47.022 --> 00:10:48.481
What do you mean by that?

00:10:48.481 --> 00:10:51.818
You're staying overnight
here, too, right, Nonoka?

00:10:51.818 --> 00:10:53.528
No, I'm going home.

00:10:53.528 --> 00:10:56.031
She won't be participating in Quartet.

00:10:56.031 --> 00:10:58.450
Besides, she isn't even a Butei High student.

00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:01.703
Well then, I'll get going. Huh?

00:11:01.703 --> 00:11:02.829
What's wrong?

00:11:02.829 --> 00:11:05.582
I just felt dizzy, that's all.

00:11:05.582 --> 00:11:09.961
Are you okay? Maybe you
should stay here and rest after all?

00:11:09.961 --> 00:11:12.047
Well, it's not that bad.

00:11:12.047 --> 00:11:16.009
Why don't you do that?
I'll feel better that way.

00:11:16.009 --> 00:11:18.595
Well then, I'll take you up
on your offer. Thank you.

00:11:18.595 --> 00:11:21.681
All right! Both sisters are staying overnight!

00:11:23.224 --> 00:11:26.019
Quartet will be held on Monday.

00:11:26.019 --> 00:11:30.899
Since today is Friday, we can
spend the entire weekend training.

00:11:30.899 --> 00:11:34.861
Our opposing team consists
of Urara Takachiho, Hina Fuma,

00:11:34.861 --> 00:11:38.865
and the twin sisters Yuyu and Yaya Aizawa.

00:11:38.865 --> 00:11:41.242
The match the Masters
assigned us to fight in is...

00:11:41.242 --> 00:11:42.202
"Four Persons vs. Four Persons"
"Poison (Attack by Poison)"

00:11:42.202 --> 00:11:43.703
...Poison.

00:11:43.703 --> 00:11:45.830
Each member in both teams
will carry an attack flag

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:50.126
with the picture of the bug assigned
to their team, a bee or a spider.

00:11:50.126 --> 00:11:55.423
Each team also has a flag it needs
to protect with a picture of an eye on it.

00:11:55.423 --> 00:12:00.095
The team whose attack flag
touches the eye flag first wins.

00:12:00.095 --> 00:12:03.098
Once your eye is stung by
a poisonous bug, you lose, huh?

00:12:03.098 --> 00:12:04.182
That's right.

00:12:04.182 --> 00:12:06.101
We're the bee team, huh?

00:12:06.101 --> 00:12:08.937
Oh no, I hate bees.

00:12:10.647 --> 00:12:12.941
The test will be held on the mega-float,

00:12:12.941 --> 00:12:15.985
within the entire Zone 11 of Butei High grounds.

00:12:15.985 --> 00:12:18.988
You can use anything you find within the zone.

00:12:18.988 --> 00:12:20.824
Those are the basic rules.

00:12:20.824 --> 00:12:22.283
That's very simple.

00:12:22.283 --> 00:12:23.326
Yeah.

00:12:23.326 --> 00:12:26.955
But all sorts of abilities, including
hiding, attacking, and withdrawing,

00:12:26.955 --> 00:12:28.456
will be tested.

00:12:28.456 --> 00:12:31.960
That's my student Rin-Rin!

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:35.380
Riko! So you came!

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:38.925
Well, it was a request from
my dear former Amica, so...

00:12:38.925 --> 00:12:41.219
Thank you very much!

00:12:41.219 --> 00:12:42.721
Riko Mine...

00:12:42.721 --> 00:12:45.473
She always looks beautiful.

00:12:45.473 --> 00:12:48.727
Poison, huh? It brings back memories.

00:12:48.727 --> 00:12:51.604
<i>Butei </i>should protect themselves.

00:12:51.604 --> 00:12:54.149
I won't protect my underclassmen.

00:12:54.149 --> 00:12:55.567
But...

00:12:55.567 --> 00:12:57.444
...I can train them.

00:13:00.155 --> 00:13:02.657
Shino-cchi, you'll train to deal with the twins.

00:13:03.825 --> 00:13:08.496
--I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry...!
--I'm sorry, Miss Shino! I'm sorry...!

00:13:08.496 --> 00:13:10.915
The strongest one should indeed guard the flag.

00:13:10.915 --> 00:13:15.211
Even in an unfavorable situation,
trust your friends and buy time for them.

00:13:19.799 --> 00:13:23.720
Why am I the only one
who's doing something like this?!

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:25.638
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:13:25.638 --> 00:13:28.516
A <i>butei </i>who just fights
will be brought down quickly.

00:13:28.516 --> 00:13:30.977
B-But...!

00:13:32.812 --> 00:13:34.314
Ow, ow, ow...

00:13:42.572 --> 00:13:45.116
She's such an earnest girl.

00:13:45.116 --> 00:13:47.911
Amicas think alike.

00:13:47.911 --> 00:13:50.830
I can learn a lot about Aria from her.

00:13:53.083 --> 00:13:54.709
"Tofuchikuwa"

00:13:58.380 --> 00:14:02.425
Oh, wow...! Why the horseback-riding machine?!

00:14:06.721 --> 00:14:09.307
Are you... Riko Mine?

00:14:09.307 --> 00:14:12.060
That's right. I'm your sister's upperclassman.

00:14:12.060 --> 00:14:16.106
Everyone is training right now,
so I came to check on you in their place.

00:14:16.106 --> 00:14:20.944
I'm really okay now.
I felt a little dizzy, that's all.

00:14:20.944 --> 00:14:23.571
I see. Then I guess we
don't have to worry, huh?

00:14:23.571 --> 00:14:28.743
Uhm... Is there anything I can do
to help my sister and her friends?

00:14:28.743 --> 00:14:32.080
Oh, don't worry about them.

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:34.207
You're a good girl too, Nonoka.

00:14:36.001 --> 00:14:39.087
But good girls die early.

00:14:41.589 --> 00:14:43.341
Are you okay, Sis?

00:14:43.341 --> 00:14:46.052
My head's still spinning.

00:14:46.052 --> 00:14:48.555
Are <i>you </i>feeling better, Nonoka?

00:14:48.555 --> 00:14:50.348
Yep. Completely!

00:14:50.348 --> 00:14:54.436
I'm gonna eat! Or I won't last tomorrow!

00:14:56.021 --> 00:14:57.564
Oh no!

00:14:57.564 --> 00:14:59.399
Are you okay?!

00:15:01.526 --> 00:15:04.237
Would you like me to feed you?

00:15:04.237 --> 00:15:04.696
Huh?

00:15:04.696 --> 00:15:06.531
Here, open wide.

00:15:06.531 --> 00:15:09.576
Ahh! That tickles!

00:15:09.576 --> 00:15:11.786
Would you like me to feed you, too?

00:15:11.786 --> 00:15:14.456
Huh? No! You don't have to!

00:15:14.456 --> 00:15:17.125
Don't be modest, Kirin. Here, open wide.

00:15:17.125 --> 00:15:19.836
Excuse me! There's nothing
wrong with you goofing around...

00:15:19.836 --> 00:15:20.712
Hm?

00:15:20.712 --> 00:15:23.006
...but we're currently in training.

00:15:23.006 --> 00:15:25.342
Please don't spoil her so much!

00:15:25.342 --> 00:15:28.136
Oh...? You're jealous, aren't you?

00:15:28.136 --> 00:15:31.681
You're going crazy with jealousy.
You're so cute!

00:15:31.681 --> 00:15:33.475
I-I'm not!

00:15:33.475 --> 00:15:37.645
Oh, that's right. Shino-cchi,
I heard that you became Hotogi's Amica.

00:15:37.645 --> 00:15:38.438
Yes.

00:15:38.438 --> 00:15:44.486
Oh, yeah, Shino!
How'd you become Hotogi's Amica?

00:15:44.486 --> 00:15:48.782
I asked the Masters to
make a recommendation for me.

00:15:56.164 --> 00:16:01.836
I feel that you have very strong,
devoted feelings towards someone.

00:16:01.836 --> 00:16:04.130
I bet you and I are alike.

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:05.298
Huh?

00:16:05.298 --> 00:16:08.635
I'll check and see if you're a fit as my Amica

00:16:08.635 --> 00:16:11.888
while I give you training that
can help you achieve those desires.

00:16:11.888 --> 00:16:13.223
Yes, ma'am.

00:16:14.516 --> 00:16:18.353
Cooking is a Japanese woman's
traditional technique to show her love!

00:16:18.353 --> 00:16:20.313
Yes, ma'am! I'll do my best!

00:16:20.313 --> 00:16:21.898
Be patient while they warm up to you!

00:16:21.898 --> 00:16:23.525
Be patient while they warm up to you!

00:16:24.150 --> 00:16:27.946
Infrared cameras are more effective
on swimsuits than on underwear!

00:16:27.946 --> 00:16:29.030
This is very educational!

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:31.908
Run the pictures you take through
software and analyze them in detail!

00:16:31.908 --> 00:16:34.369
And I need to back them up
at least in three places, right?!

00:16:34.369 --> 00:16:37.038
Shirayuki is teaching earnestly!

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:41.584
Eliminate your rival in love immediately!

00:16:41.584 --> 00:16:42.794
Eliminate them immediately!

00:16:42.794 --> 00:16:45.171
Especially when her hair is pink,

00:16:45.171 --> 00:16:46.923
you can bring her down as soon as you find her!

00:16:46.923 --> 00:16:48.425
What a splendid performance!

00:16:48.425 --> 00:16:51.845
Don't make a move on my Kin!

00:16:51.845 --> 00:16:53.638
Whoa!

00:16:53.638 --> 00:16:56.099
Then you're making me your Amica?!

00:16:56.099 --> 00:16:57.267
Of course!

00:16:59.144 --> 00:17:01.521
She really is a wonderful person.

00:17:02.939 --> 00:17:04.274
Shino?

00:17:04.274 --> 00:17:06.651
What's the matter? You stopped talking.

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:12.240
It's so late. Why don't you stay here overnight?

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:16.411
Oh, that's okay. Besides, if I stay,
I may get in someone's way.

00:17:18.538 --> 00:17:21.791
And... remember Butei Charter Article 6.

00:17:21.791 --> 00:17:25.587
Think for yourself and act on your own.

00:17:25.587 --> 00:17:26.588
Yes, ma'am!

00:17:28.757 --> 00:17:30.467
Thank you for your lessons!

00:17:32.802 --> 00:17:36.473
Raika... Are you still upset?

00:17:37.557 --> 00:17:41.519
It makes me happy when you get jealous over me.

00:17:41.519 --> 00:17:44.272
Please don't be upset with me.

00:17:44.272 --> 00:17:46.941
I'm not upset or anything.

00:17:46.941 --> 00:17:48.109
But...

00:17:48.109 --> 00:17:49.444
But?

00:17:49.444 --> 00:17:53.365
...I was wondering if it was really
okay for me to be your Amica.

00:17:53.365 --> 00:17:54.949
Huh?

00:17:54.949 --> 00:17:59.412
Akari's got Aria. Shino's got Hotogi.

00:17:59.412 --> 00:18:02.582
Their Amicas are incredible people.

00:18:02.582 --> 00:18:06.503
I'm a Year 1 student who's just good at sports.

00:18:06.503 --> 00:18:09.881
You're my only Amica.

00:18:09.881 --> 00:18:13.468
I've been watching you for a long time.

00:18:15.178 --> 00:18:16.805
For a long time?

00:18:16.805 --> 00:18:17.806
Yes...

00:18:19.474 --> 00:18:23.061
...since I went to the gym with
my friends to observe Butei High's classes.

00:18:26.981 --> 00:18:30.652
But because I'm small and weak,

00:18:30.652 --> 00:18:34.781
I worried whether someone like you
who's strong would accept me.

00:18:34.781 --> 00:18:37.575
So I couldn't talk to you all this time.

00:18:37.575 --> 00:18:39.994
When I asked to be your Amica the other day,

00:18:39.994 --> 00:18:43.164
I did it by mustering up all the courage I had.

00:18:47.377 --> 00:18:51.756
Raika, Kirin. They said
that our bedrooms are ready.

00:18:51.756 --> 00:18:53.550
Okay.

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:55.427
Well then, shall we go to bed?

00:18:55.427 --> 00:18:57.762
Yes, ma'am!

00:18:57.762 --> 00:19:00.348
This is Miss Akari Mamiya's pillow!

00:19:00.348 --> 00:19:03.685
And this is a brand new
pillow that's just like hers!

00:19:03.685 --> 00:19:05.311
Wow...

00:19:06.646 --> 00:19:07.939
Good job!

00:19:07.939 --> 00:19:09.524
Thank you!

00:19:09.524 --> 00:19:11.401
Akari's pillow...

00:19:11.401 --> 00:19:14.195
I'll switch this with the new one
and tell her that I got it dry cleaned!

00:19:14.195 --> 00:19:16.948
I'm giving her a new one, so it's okay, right?!

00:19:16.948 --> 00:19:20.744
Shirayuki... I'm trying hard!

00:19:23.663 --> 00:19:27.292
If I keep practicing all weekend,
I should be able to become good at riding this!

00:19:31.338 --> 00:19:33.381
I'm going to raise my rank without fail...

00:19:33.381 --> 00:19:35.884
...so that that dream won't come true!

00:19:35.884 --> 00:19:37.385
What're you doing?

00:19:37.385 --> 00:19:39.637
Ah...! Aria?!

00:19:42.766 --> 00:19:45.810
I see... So Riko gave you training, huh?

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:48.730
But you're the only one
who's training right now.

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:52.067
I stopped by thinking that
you might already be in bed.

00:19:52.067 --> 00:19:54.110
Why are you pushing so hard?

00:19:55.737 --> 00:19:58.907
Because Takachiho told me that I can't.

00:19:58.907 --> 00:19:59.949
You can't?

00:19:59.949 --> 00:20:03.370
That's the phrase you forbade me to use, so...

00:20:06.915 --> 00:20:11.211
Geez... You're so scrupulously honest.

00:20:11.211 --> 00:20:14.506
Well, I do like that about you.

00:20:15.507 --> 00:20:21.262
It's been a while since you became
a candidate to be my Amica, hasn't it?

00:20:21.262 --> 00:20:22.764
Ah, yes.

00:20:22.764 --> 00:20:26.226
I sometimes give you lessons,
but are you mastering them okay?

00:20:26.226 --> 00:20:28.186
Ah... that's...

00:20:31.773 --> 00:20:33.274
Come at me.

00:20:33.274 --> 00:20:36.695
I'll check and see how much
you've improved in a one-on-one match.

00:20:36.695 --> 00:20:38.863
What? You mean now?

00:20:38.863 --> 00:20:41.074
What're you so surprised about?

00:20:41.074 --> 00:20:44.828
I told you that you'd become
my official Amica as soon as you--

00:20:46.663 --> 00:20:48.790
That wasn't too bad.

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:52.127
But your moves are simplistic;
your opponent can read them.

00:20:52.127 --> 00:20:53.795
Be flexible when you fight.

00:20:53.795 --> 00:20:56.172
Be flexible when you fight!

00:21:08.768 --> 00:21:10.145
You still have a long way to go.

00:21:10.145 --> 00:21:11.771
Ow, ow, ow...

00:21:11.771 --> 00:21:13.231
But...

00:21:13.231 --> 00:21:16.151
...it seems that your movements
are gradually becoming similar to mine.

00:21:16.151 --> 00:21:16.985
What?

00:21:16.985 --> 00:21:19.154
I'll be watching the match, too.

00:21:19.154 --> 00:21:20.363
Make sure you win.

00:21:20.363 --> 00:21:22.073
"Safe Childbirth Charm"

00:21:22.991 --> 00:21:24.492
Whoa!

00:21:24.492 --> 00:21:26.244
Thank you very much!

00:21:29.622 --> 00:21:34.294
Hiding flags and passing them to
other team members are allowed.

00:21:34.294 --> 00:21:37.505
But the only kind of bullet
you can fire is rubber bullets, okay?

00:21:37.505 --> 00:21:41.760
Still, people can be killed by
those bullets when they're hit in the head.

00:21:44.346 --> 00:21:46.097
Let's do our best!

00:21:47.474 --> 00:21:48.641
Akari!

00:21:48.641 --> 00:21:51.186
You think we're in the same league?

00:21:51.186 --> 00:21:52.520
How rude.

00:21:54.230 --> 00:21:58.151
One's soul dwells in those they taught.

00:21:59.861 --> 00:22:01.821
Well, good luck.

00:22:08.912 --> 00:22:09.079
"Episode 4: Quartet, Part 1"

00:22:09.079 --> 00:22:11.122
"Episode 4: Quartet, Part 1"
We won't lose!

00:23:41.629 --> 00:23:43.465
I wonder if this is also our fate!

00:23:43.465 --> 00:23:45.258
--Akari!
--You should... focus those eyes on me!

00:23:45.258 --> 00:23:47.469
--Raika!
--How was it? Did it hurt?

00:23:47.469 --> 00:23:50.347
--I don't care what you say about me.
--I'm glad...

00:23:50.347 --> 00:23:52.557
...that I'll be able to bring
you down with my own hands.

00:23:52.557 --> 00:23:56.160
I'm not gonna fall off!
